                                                "text": "Girls, hey, what's that you're doing\nGirl, girl, what's that you're doing\nYou got to show me the steps to it\nSomehow, gonna learn how to do it\nDoing the jerk\nHey, do the jerk\nGirl, come on and work\nHey, do the jerk."
